{"id":"204688fe55372897","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-diamond-principle.md","title":"Diamond Principle","display":"thm-diamond-principle — Diamond Principle","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-diamond-principle","aliases":["58-thm-diamond-principle"],"display":"thm-diamond-principle — Diamond Principle","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-diamond-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-diamond-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-diamond-principle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diamond-principle — Diamond Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md\">../batch20/58-df-diamond.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d00fb89d36e20b8\" href=\"?note=5d00fb89d36e20b8\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-diamond-sequence.md\">../batch19/58-df-diamond-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (regular uncountable cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec A=\\langle A_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\rangle\">\\(\\vec A=\\langle A_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\rangle\\)</span> (diamond sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\">\\(\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\)</span> (diamond principle, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md\">../batch20/58-df-diamond.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa(\\vec A)\">\\(\\diamondsuit_\\kappa(\\vec A)\\)</span> (diamond-sequence witness predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\left(\n\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec A\\;\\diamondsuit_\\kappa(\\vec A)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\left(\n\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec A\\;\\diamondsuit_\\kappa(\\vec A)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The principle quantifies the guessing sequence existentially; a fixed sequence is a witness, not the principle itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-diamond-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d00fb89d36e20b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-diamond-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\diamondsuit_\\kappa$ (diamond principle, see [[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec A=\\langle A_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha<\\kappa\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa(\\vec A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\n\\left(\n\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec A\\;\\diamondsuit_\\kappa(\\vec A)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1069,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-diamond-principle.md|58-thm-diamond-principle]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d60e0a36bd259287","5d00fb89d36e20b8"]}